WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
ToolSpace: Scaling Tool-Centric Environment Synthesis for Long-Horizon Agents.

00:03.000 --> 00:10.600
Real tasks span many environments. ToolSpace starts from tools and their dependencies.

00:10.800 --> 00:17.800
Connect tools, ground environments, and sample long-horizon paths.

00:18.000 --> 00:25.000
This project-page graph simulation follows tool calls across familiar environments.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.350
The camera follows the selected route through the environment network.

00:32.350 --> 00:34.780
A simulated candidate is rejected. Return to the previous node and resample.

00:34.780 --> 00:42.000
The selected path reaches ten environments in 32 accepted steps.

00:42.000 --> 00:45.500
ToolSpace reverse-synthesizes tasks and verifies them by replay.
The green wave illustrates this verification stage.

00:45.500 --> 00:48.000
The paper reports 2,042 canonical tools and 804 environments.

00:48.000 --> 00:54.000
ToolSpace-744B-A40B, trained with SFT, averages 56.6 across seven benchmarks.
Smaller models improve further with agent RL after SFT.

00:54.000 --> 00:58.000
Final scores on AutomationBench Pro and Tau3 Banking Pro.

00:58.000 --> 01:00.000
ToolSpace. Start with tools. Scale verifiable tasks.
